# Blackwing dev-host toolchain pins (DEVENV-001).
#
# Sourced by infra/bootstrap.sh. Every tool is installed at the exact version
# below and every downloaded artifact is verified against the checksum pinned
# here (CONTEXT_PACK §8.9: runs never silently float). Plain KEY="value" lines
# only: no command substitution, so the file is safe to source and easy for
# Renovate to bump. When bumping a version, update its checksums in the same
# commit (the values come from the upstream release's published checksum file).
#
# Arch suffixes: _AMD64 = x86_64, _ARM64 = aarch64.

# --- Docker Engine (apt, repo signature verified against the pinned key) -----
# renovate: datasource=deb depName=docker-ce
